  "content": "`<style>p{text-align:justify;}</style>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"A Serilum Mod. Made with love. Lots of active mods for Fabric, Forge and Neo!\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">附魔命令是一个简约的模组，允许通过命令轻松创建具有超过默认等级限制的附魔物品。与添加自定义附魔的其他模组兼容。在命令过程中可以使用 Tab 键进行自动补全。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含在 vanilla experience 中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含在 Serilum&#x27;s QoL Bundle 中\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enchantCommandString</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值为 \"ec\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">使用此模组功能的默认命令。默认为 /ec。如果与其他模组冲突，可以更改。</span><br><br></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><em>/ec 命令的基本用法。</em></strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/a.png\" alt=\"ec\" width=\"752\" height=\"178\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><strong>(1.16) 附魔列表。</strong></em></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"752\" height=\"215\"><br><br><em><strong>兼容其他模组的附魔：</strong><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"832\" height=\"422\"><br><br><strong>为手头物品添加附魔。</strong></em><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/d.png\" alt=\"ecsharp\" width=\"731\" height=\"134\"><br><br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/e.png\" alt=\"ecsharpsword\" width=\"425\" height=\"178\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><strong>也可以为非工具类物品添加附魔。</strong></em></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/f.png\" alt=\"ecknockback\" width=\"670\" height=\"125\"><br><br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/g.png\" alt=\"ecknockbackstick\" width=\"414\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"注意与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由将此模组用于任何模组包，只要下载仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于无法跟踪大量独立模组页面上的评论，因此已禁用评论功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">对于问题、想法、建议或其他内容，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>`",
